                                                "sense_id": "f9b3bd32-2628-3ee2-b268-8ce4b2a40182",
                                                "text": "Johnson said, “Depending on how it melts, a lot of the freshwater will be leaving the region for the ocean, which will have severe impacts on water and food security.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "depending",
